WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:07.330
previously on the abolitionists. I stand before you as a southerner, exiled from the land of my

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:16.170
birth by the sound of the lash. I stand before you as a repentant slaveholder. I learned what a

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:24.530
poor slave mother may feel when her child is torn away from her. I was a changed being after that

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:30.000
fight. I was nothing before. I was a man now. Thank you.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.720
- Mr. Douglas, join me.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:37.020
I urge you, you have a gift.

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:39.880
- My plan is to raid the plantations,

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:42.840
bring off the slaves, offer them a chance to fight.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:44.280
- Sir, the entire state of Virginia

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:45.400
will rise up against you.

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:47.550
- How many slaveholders have you converted?

00:00:47.550 --> 00:00:50.090
How many slaves have you freed?

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:53.480
- Is it not strange that Douglas has not written to me

00:00:53.480 --> 00:00:56.300
since he left me on a bed of illness?

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:59.170
- Mr. Garrison has seemed fit to invade my household

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:00.000
and has sought to bless

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:07.050
ask me in the name of my family what is the mob what if that mob should burst in upon us and commit

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:13.370
violence on our persons would this be anything compared with what the slaves endure prayers and

00:01:13.370 --> 00:01:20.830
hymns are fraud deception impiety and hypocrisy there's not a nation on earth guilty of practices

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:25.030
more shocking than the united states at this very hour

